 1145 "We will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{2}{x} \\\\ {v}^{′}=2x\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int 2x\\,\\text{d}x={x}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2x\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})\\cdot {x}^{2}-\\int {x}^{2}(\\frac{2}{x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})-\\int 2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})-2\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})-{x}^{2}+C \\\\  & ={x}^{2}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})-1)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant." 13194139534652 true] [17592186301518 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301519 13194139534652 true] [17592186301518 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301520 13194139534652 true] [17592186301518 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301521 13194139534652 true] [17592186301518 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301522 13194139534652 true] [17592186301518 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301523 13194139534652 true] [17592186301518 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534652 true] [17592186301518 1041 "selection" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301518 1104 #edb/ref 17592186301519 13194139534652 true] [17592186301518 1110 #uuid "bf19432a-bda6-5cce-bcb9-aa042d58eb7f" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301519 1034 "{x}^{2}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})-1)+C" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301519 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534652 true] [17592186301519 1111 #uuid "74057c0f-e278-5c96-b2b6-269573b365d8" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301520 1034 "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})-1)+C" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301520 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534652 true] [17592186301520 1111 #uuid "a98dec41-c185-511f-b86f-d11d62686a7e" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301521 1034 "x(\\