] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}[e-x{|}_{1}^{e}\\,] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}(e-e+1) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301543 13194139534652 true] [17592186301542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301544 13194139534652 true] [17592186301542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301545 13194139534652 true] [17592186301542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301546 13194139534652 true] [17592186301542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301547 13194139534652 true] [17592186301542 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534652 true] [17592186301542 1041 "selection" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301542 1104 #edb/ref 17592186301545 13194139534652 true] [17592186301542 1110 #uuid "39cd5324-1290-5fd0-a5e1-c982fa76ad28" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301543 1034 "\\frac{e}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301543 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534652 true] [17592186301543 1111 #uuid "2426fed9-5fc5-557f-b1eb-a34eac694e16" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301544 1034 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301544 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534652 true] [17592186301544 1111 #uuid "7e5e2c14-c39c-5342-aaba-87dcb319f28e" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301545 1034 "\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301545 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534652 true] [17592186301545 1111 #uuid "af98e46c-fa9d-5313-b126-992f4053f0ee" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301546 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}{e}" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301546 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534652 true] [17592186301546 1111 #uuid "eb88b6a5-3216-59c8-9dbd-dcc8cd9b01fe" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301547 1034 "e\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301547 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534652 true] [17592186301547 1111 #uuid "47831ab8-c986-503f-9bc9-e4829f3b72e5" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301548 1017 #edb/ref 17592186301549 13194139534652 true] [17592186301548 1089 "q-78963" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301548 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534652 true] [17592186301548 1100 "Calculate $\\int 9{x}^{2}{log}_{3}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301548 1113 #uuid "7b9ed7c7-8416-5dd4-8ed9-af068b0cd0bd" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301548 1145 "We will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={log}_{3}⁡(2x)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3} \\\\ {v}^{′}=9{x}^{2}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int 9{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x=3{x}^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 9{x}^{2}{log}_{3}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={log}_{3}⁡(2x)\\cdot (3{x}^{3})-\\int \\frac{3{x}^{3}}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{x}^{3}{log}_{3}⁡(2x)-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\int 3{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{x}^{3}{log}_{3}⁡(2x)-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\cdot {x}^{3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{3{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{3}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(3\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)-1)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant.\n\nNote that in the above calculation we used the change of base formula ${log}_{3}⁡x=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}.$" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301550 13194139534652 true] [17592186301549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301551 13194139534652 true] [17592186301549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301552 13194139534652 true] [17592186301549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301553 13194139534652 true] [17592186301549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301554 13194139534652 true] [17592186301549 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534652 true] [17592186301549 1041 "selection" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301549 1104 #edb/ref 17592186301553 13194139534652 true] [17592