d}x.\n$$\n\n \n\nWe will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x} \\\\ {v}^{′}=1\\, & ⟹\\,v=x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {log}_{2}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\int u\\,{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}[uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}[x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-\\int x\\cdot \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}[x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-\\int 1\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}-\\frac{x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant." 13194139534652 true] [17592186301556 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301557 13194139534652 true] [17592186301556 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301558 13194139534652 true] [17592186301556 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301559 13194139534652 true] [17592186301556 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301560 13194139534652 true] [17592186301556 1000 #edb/ref 17592186301561 13194139534652 true] [17592186301556 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534652 true] [17592186301556 1041 "selection" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301556 1104 #edb/ref 17592186301557 13194139534652 true] [17592186301556 1110 #uuid "56fe89b8-1b85-5f44-841a-cf5b2ec294dd" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301557 1034 "\\frac{x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1)+C" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301557 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534652 true] [17592186301557 1111 #uuid "d354ac99-1e1b-53ee-b795-8711beff0f1a" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301558 1034 "\\frac{x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+1)+C" 13194139534652 true] [17592186301558 1103 #edb/ref 17592